                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_828780237">- Output Video:  Right camera video feed grayed out in all Views (Curb view, Right flank 3D view, free floating view)  - Features Not available: i. Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA) ii. Personal Park Assist iii. Remote Parking Assist</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_715648373">1. Harness defect 2. Camera defect 3. Camera is not powered as specified by ECU</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_784024549">- Views will be blanked: Right side videos, Right Side split (curb) view and Right flank 3D view, free floating view - Features that rely on Right Camera will be unavailable</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
