5. CMRR-FL role and scan config is incorrect during start up i.e. Hydra3 receives RadarRoleConfig != 0x2 (RadarRoleConfig_ROLE_CORNER_FL) from message RADAR_CFG (0x600) during Start up via HSCAN4. 
