MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SNA) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec. 
OR 
7. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0xC (SENSOR_ST_SAFETY_ERROR) from RADAR_STATE (0x301) message and it is valid for 200 msec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1447187196">Hydra3_component shall not log any DTC if all the conditions below are True-  1. Received lost messages from the MRR node and valid for 200 msec
