AND 
6. Hydra3 receives MRRTimesyncStatus = 0x1 (MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SYNCED) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec. </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_185372194">- Features in error state : i. Lane change assist (LCA)  - Features degraded : i. Traffic jam assist (TJA) / Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA)/ Lane Centering Control (LCC),   ii. Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go  - High critical degradation if following features are engaged :  i. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision  Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, ii. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, iii. Evasive Steering Assist (ESA), iv. Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)  - High critical degradation if following features are disengaged :  i. Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, ii. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP  - Low critical degradation if following features are engaged : i. Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, ii. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP  - Error if following features are disengaged : i. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision  Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, ii. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, iii. Evasive Steering Assist (ESA), iv. Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)</SD>
