RADAR_CFG (0x600) message missing for 200 msec OR 3. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0x7 (SENSOR_ST_EXTERNAL_ERROR) from ||RADAR_STATE (0x301) message and it is valid for 200 msec OR
4. For the message RADAR_INFO (0x300)||OBJ_DATA_00 (0x310)||OBJ_DATA_01 (0x311)||OBJ_DATA_02 (0x312)||OBJ_DATA_03 (0x313)||OBJ_DATA_04 (0x314)||OBJ_DATA_05 (0x315)||OBJ_DATA_06 (0x316)||OBJ_DATA_07 (0x317)||OBJ_DATA_08 (0x318)||OBJ_DATA_09 (0x319)||OBJ_DATA_10 (0x31A)||OBJ_DATA_11 (0x31B)||OBJ_DATA_12 (0x31C)||OBJ_DATA_13 (0x31D)||OBJ_DATA_14 (0x31E)||OBJ_DATA_15 (0x31F)||OBJ_DATA_16 (0x320)||OBJ_DATA_17 (0x321)||OBJ_DATA_18 (0x322)||OBJ_DATA_19 (0x323)||OBJ_DATA_20 (0x324)||OBJ_DATA_21 (0x325)||OBJ_DATA_22 (0x326)||OBJ_DATA_23 (0x327)||OBJ_DATA_24 (0x328)||OBJ_DATA_25 (0x329)||OBJ_DATA_26 (0x32A)||OBJ_DATA_27 (0x32B)||OBJ_DATA_28 (0x32C)||OBJ_DATA_29 (0x32D)||OBJ_DATA_30 (0x32E)||OBJ_DATA_31 (0x32F)||ROAD_BORDER (0x500)||RADAR_CFG (0x600)||RADAR_STATE (0x301), if  - CRC verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeated in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - MAC verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages 

OR 
5. CMRR-RL role and scan config is incorrect during start up i.e. Hydra3 receives RadarRoleConfig != 0x4 (RadarRoleConfig_ROLE_CORNER_RL) from message RADAR_CFG (0x600) during Start up via HSCAN6. 
OR 
6. Hydra3 receives MRRTimesyncStatus = 0x0 (MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_NOT_SYNCED) || 0x3 ( 
MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SNA) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec.
OR 
7. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0xC (SENSOR_ST_SAFETY_ERROR) from RADAR_STATE (0x301) message and it is valid for 200 msec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1875199384">Hydra3_component shall not log any DTC if all the conditions below are True-  1. Received lost messages from the MRR node and valid for 200 msec
AND 2. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0x0 (SENSOR_ST_INIT) || 0x1 (SENSOR_ST_NORMAL) || 0x9 ( SENSOR_ST_SCAN_DISABLED) from message RADAR_STATE (0x301) and it is valid for 200 msec. AND 3. Flash/re-flash is successful AND 4. No CRC, MAC, Message Counter error (All signal values are valid) and last for 1 cycle. 
AND 
5. Hydra3 receives RadarRoleConfig = 0x4 (RadarRoleConfig_ROLE_CORNER_RL) from message RADAR_CFG (0x600) during Start up via HSCAN6 
AND 
6. Hydra3 receives MRRTimesyncStatus = 0x1 (MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SYNCED) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec. </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1942872243">FID_LCA_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_BSM_Critical_Impact FID_RCTB_RCW_Safety_Critical FID_ESA_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_LCW_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_DOW_Critical_Impact FID_RL_MRR_Failure</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1485994502">- Harness defect - CMRR-RL Sensor defect</SD>
