                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1527493605">EC 1- Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)   
EC 2- BCM_PwrMod == IGN ON(0x2)||RUN(0x4)
EC 3-  BUS physical status  
EC 4- De-bounce timer
-Hydra3 has not requested the MRR to go into Low power mode.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1340650257">Continue</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_592668466">20ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_2071820179">The Hydra3_component shall log the DTC if any one of the following conditions is met -  1. RADAR_INFO (0x300)||OBJ_DATA_00 (0x310)||OBJ_DATA_01 (0x311)||OBJ_DATA_02 (0x312)||OBJ_DATA_03 (0x313)||OBJ_DATA_04 (0x314)||OBJ_DATA_05 (0x315)||OBJ_DATA_06 (0x316)||OBJ_DATA_07 (0x317)||OBJ_DATA_08 (0x318)||OBJ_DATA_09 (0x319)||OBJ_DATA_10 (0x31A)||OBJ_DATA_11 (0x31B)||OBJ_DATA_12 (0x31C)||OBJ_DATA_13 (0x31D)||OBJ_DATA_14 (0x31E)||OBJ_DATA_15 (0x31F)||OBJ_DATA_16 (0x320)||OBJ_DATA_17 (0x321)||OBJ_DATA_18 (0x322)||OBJ_DATA_19 (0x323)||OBJ_DATA_20 (0x324)||OBJ_DATA_21 (0x325)||OBJ_DATA_22 (0x326)||OBJ_DATA_23 (0x327)||OBJ_DATA_24 (0x328)||OBJ_DATA_25 (0x329)||OBJ_DATA_26 (0x32A)||OBJ_DATA_27 (0x32B)||OBJ_DATA_28 (0x32C)||OBJ_DATA_29 (0x32D)||OBJ_DATA_30 (0x32E)||OBJ_DATA_31 (0x32F)||ROAD_BORDER (0x500)||RADAR_STATE (0x301) || 
RADAR_CFG (0x600) message missing for 200 msec 
OR 3. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0x7 (SENSOR_ST_EXTERNAL_ERROR) from RADAR_STATE (0x301) message and it is valid for 200 msec OR
4. For the message RADAR_INFO (0x300)||OBJ_DATA_00 (0x310)||OBJ_DATA_01 (0x311)||OBJ_DATA_02 (0x312)||OBJ_DATA_03 (0x313)||OBJ_DATA_04 (0x314)||OBJ_DATA_05 (0x315)||OBJ_DATA_06 (0x316)||OBJ_DATA_07 (0x317)||OBJ_DATA_08 (0x318)||OBJ_DATA_09 (0x319)||OBJ_DATA_10 (0x31A)||OBJ_DATA_11 (0x31B)||OBJ_DATA_12 (0x31C)||OBJ_DATA_13 (0x31D)||OBJ_DATA_14 (0x31E)||OBJ_DATA_15 (0x31F)||OBJ_DATA_16 (0x320)||OBJ_DATA_17 (0x321)||OBJ_DATA_18 (0x322)||OBJ_DATA_19 (0x323)||OBJ_DATA_20 (0x324)||OBJ_DATA_21 (0x325)||OBJ_DATA_22 (0x326)||OBJ_DATA_23 (0x327)||OBJ_DATA_24 (0x328)||OBJ_DATA_25 (0x329)||OBJ_DATA_26 (0x32A)||OBJ_DATA_27 (0x32B)||OBJ_DATA_28 (0x32C)||OBJ_DATA_29 (0x32D)||OBJ_DATA_30 (0x32E)||OBJ_DATA_31 (0x32F)||ROAD_BORDER (0x500)||RADAR_CFG (0x600)||RADAR_STATE (0x301), if - CRC verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeated in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - MAC verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages 

OR 
5. CMRR-RR role and scan config is incorrect during start up i.e. Hydra3 receives RadarRoleConfig != 0x5 (RadarRoleConfig_ROLE_CORNER_RR) from message RADAR_CFG (0x600) during Start up via HSCAN5. 
