MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SNA) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec.  
OR 
7. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0xC (SENSOR_ST_SAFETY_ERROR) from RADAR_STATE (0x301) message and it is valid for 200 msec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1431058182">Hydra3_component shall not log any DTC if all the conditions below are True-  1. Received lost messages from the MRR node and valid for 200 msec
AND 2. Hydra3 receives SensorStatus - 0x0 (SENSOR_ST_INIT) || 0x1 (SENSOR_ST_NORMAL) || 0x9 ( SENSOR_ST_SCAN_DISABLED) from message RADAR_STATE (0x301) and it is valid for 200 msec. AND 3. Flash/re-flash is successful AND 4. No CRC, MAC, Message Counter error (All signal values are valid) and last for 1 cycle. 
AND 
5. Hydra3 receives RadarRoleConfig = 0x5 (RadarRoleConfig_ROLE_CORNER_RR) from message RADAR_CFG (0x600) during Start up via HSCAN5 
AND 
6. Hydra3 receives MRRTimesyncStatus = 0x1 (MRRTimesyncStatus_TSYNC_SYNCED) from RADAR_INFO (0x300) message and it is valid for 650 msec. </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_816728007">- Features in error state : i. Lane change assist (LCA), ii. Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM), iii. Door Opening Incident Warning (DOIW)  - High critical degradation if following features are engaged :   i. Evasive Steering Assist (ESA), ii. Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)  - Error if following features are disengaged :   i. Evasive Steering Assist (ESA), ii. Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA),   iii. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB: RCTM  - Error if following features are engaged :  i. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic FID_LCA_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_ACC_Low_Impact FID_VRU_FCW_Medium FID_LTAP_FCW_Medium FID_SCP_FCW_Medium FID_RCTB_RCW_Safety_Critical FID_ESA_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_LCW_Safety_Critical_Impact FID_RR_MRR_Failure </SD>
