                                <DTC ID="DTCC21AE00" OID="0819ce05-e6b8-4c98-b31e-f41fb62139d6">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCC21AE00</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>6401536</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>C21AE00</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_261020855">Short VIN mismatch </TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1732356815">Service immediately</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_849435653">TBD</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1685949360">- Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)  - BCM_PwrMod == IGN ON(0x2)||RUN(0x4)  - BUS physical status  - De-bounce timer </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1624548957">On - Demand</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_440330790">During Start -up, after writing DID 0xF108 and after writing total VIN using DID 0xF190</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_2011512998">The Hydra3_component shall set the DTC Immediately, If the last 7 digit of the VIN (DID 0xF190) is not matching with the short VIN of the CDS (DID 0xF108 and/or 0xEFFA) 

Note: Hydra3 shall receive the short VIN from BCM_0x6E0_A (Cycle time 5 sec)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1353713078">The Hydra3_component shall not set this DTC If the last 7 digit of the VIN (DID 0xF190) is the same as the short VIN of the CDS (DID 0xF108 and/or 0xEFFA)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1595656206">For High-Speed Safety features:  FID_AEB_Critical_Impact FID_VRU_Critical_Impact FID_SCP_Critical_Impact FID_RCTAB_Critical_Impact FID_LTAP_Critical_Impact FID_ESA_Critical_Impact FID_LKA_Critical_Impact 

For the definition of above limp-home actions, refer to Requirement 16315106    Features that are in error state/Not available/Deactivated: 
All the comfort features and low speed safety features will be unavailable. 

Comfort and low speed safety Feature List - 1. Lane Change Assist (LCA) 2. Traffic jam assist (TJA) 3. Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA) 4. Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go 
5. Auto High Beam (AHB) 
6. Intelligent Speed Assist (ISA) 
7. Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM) 
8. Traffic Sign/Light Recognition (TSLR) 
9. Door Opening Incident Warning (DOIW)  10. Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Rear Automatic Emergency Braking: RAEB 11. Wheel scratch-prevention Parking Assist  (WSP) 12. Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA) 13. Personal Park Assist 14. Remote Parking Assist</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_654760850"> VIN mismatch</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_514411925">1. Incorrect calibrations 
2. Invalid coding 
3. Low speed safety features will not be available 4. All comfort features will be unavailable. 5. Critical impact degradation/Fault indication for all high-speed safety features.</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
