                                <DTC ID="DTCU15B186" OID="e4137475-02bd-4357-a0f0-be9913277bd1">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCU15B186</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>14004614</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>U15B186</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_918098691">ESP (Electronic Stability Program) communication verification failure</TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_571672187">No Service</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_849435653">TBD</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1214850763">- Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)  - BCM_PwrMod == IGN ON(0x2)||RUN(0x4)  - BUS physical status  - DTC for Loss of Communication with ESP (U15AC-87) is not present  - De-bounce timer </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1340650257">Continue</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1699396825">For the message ESP_0 x 318 || ESP_0 x 261 || ESP_0x262 || ESP_0x30A|| ESP_0 x 305|| ESP_0 x 306|| ESP_0 x 332|| ESP_0 x 268|| ESP_0x120|| ESP_0x122|| ESP_0x125|| ESP_0x1B8|| ESP_0x12A, if - Check Sum verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeated in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F repeats 3 times continuously</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_675129428">DTC shall not be set if all the conditions below are met and last for 1 period - Check Sum is correct; - Counter maximum difference (MaxDeltaCounterInit)  =  1; - The Counter value is not repeated; - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F does not appear</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1805163795">- Error/not available if following features are engaged/disengaged :  Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Car2Car (Inlcuding Following and HeadOn): AEB-C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB: RCTM, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Pedestrian Collision Mitigation (Including Child) AEB-FCTM VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP Evasive Steering Assist (ESA) Lane Keep Assist (LKA) Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)  - Features Not available/Disabled:  Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Rear Automatic Emergency Braking: RAEB, Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA), Personal Park Assist, Remote Parking Assist, Lane Change Assist (LCA), Traffic jam assist (TJA) / Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA)/ Lane Centering Control (LCC), Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go Intelligent Speed Assist (ISA)  - Features Degraded:  Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM) Traffic Light Recognition (TLR) 
Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_149327311">1. The ECU/module is gone to sleep 2. Gateway forwarding error 3. Associated ECU Fault</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_373992257">Features relying on ESP messages will be degraded or unavailable</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DTCU15B286" OID="e3c8673b-ab11-4b17-b6fa-9bfb6e71fc37">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCU15B286</SHORT-NAME>
                                    <TROUBLE-CODE>14004870</TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>U15B286</DISPLAY-TROUBLE-CODE>
                                    <TEXT TI="TI_1226341949"> EPS (Electrical Power Steering) communication verification failure</TEXT>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_571672187">No Service</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_849435653">TBD</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_970975077">- Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)  - BCM_PwrMod == IGN ON(0x2)||RUN(0x4)  - BUS physical status  - DTC for Loss of Communication with EPS (U15AD-87) is not present  - De-bounce timer </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1340650257">Continue</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_2029378695">For the message EPS_0 x 1C4 || EPS_0 x 1C2, if - Check Sum verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeted in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F repeats 3 times continuously</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_675129428">DTC shall not be set if all the conditions below are met and last for 1 period - Check Sum is correct; - Counter maximum difference (MaxDeltaCounterInit)  =  1; - The Counter value is not repeated; - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F does not appear</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1615392232">- High critical degradation if following features are disengaged :  Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Car2Car (Inlcuding Following and HeadOn): AEB-C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB: RCTM, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Pedestrian Collision Mitigation (Including Child) AEB-FCTM VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP  - Medium critical degradation if following features are engaged :  Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Car2Car (Inlcuding Following and HeadOn): AEB-C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB: RCTM, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Pedestrian Collision Mitigation (Including Child) AEB-FCTM VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP  - Feature Not available/Disabled:  Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA), Personal Park Assist, Remote Parking Assist, Lane Change Assist (LCA), Traffic jam assist (TJA) / Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA)/ Lane Centering Control (LCC) Evasive Steering Assist (ESA) Lane Keep Assist (LKA) Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)  - Feature Degraded:  Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go, Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM)  - No dynamic overlays</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_149327311">1. The ECU/module is gone to sleep 2. Gateway forwarding error 3. Associated ECU Fault</SD>
