                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_571672187">No Service</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1960144658">1. Reconnect the battery 2. Ensure correct gateway functionality 3. Check the network status 4. Check the ECU</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1968168612">- ECU power supply must be in normal range (9-16V) - DTC for Loss of Communication with BCM (U15AF-87) is not present</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1340650257">Continue</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1043598130">For the message BCM_0x333 || BCM_0x335 || BCM_0x343, if - Check Sum verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeated in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F repeats 3 times continuously</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_675129428">DTC shall not be set if all the conditions below are met and last for 1 period - Check Sum is correct; - Counter maximum difference (MaxDeltaCounterInit)  =  1; - The Counter value is not repeated; - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F does not appear</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1802494458">- Rear View Only (Dynamic Overlays are possible)  - Features Not available/Disabled:  Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Rear Automatic Emergency Braking: RAEB Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA), Personal Park Assist, Remote Parking Assist, Lane Change Assist (LCA), Traffic jam assist (TJA) / Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA)/ Lane Centering Control (LCC), Auto High Beam (AHB) Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go Intelligent Speed Assist (ISA) 
 - Features Degraded:  Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM), Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR), 
Traffic Light Recognition (TLR),  Door Opening Incident Warning (DOIW)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_149327311">1. The ECU/module is gone to sleep 2. Gateway forwarding error 3. Associated ECU Fault</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1588356956">Features relying on BCM messages will be degraded or unavailable</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DTCU15B586" OID="33d88f57-8659-4f1d-970e-7867c6e315ed">
                                    <SHORT-NAME>DTCU15B586</SHORT-NAME>
