                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_184056387">1. Re connect the battery 2. Ensure correct gateway functionality 3. Check the network status 4. Check the ECU</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1492303708">- Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V)  - BCM_PwrMod == IGN ON(0x2)||RUN(0x4)  - BUS physical status  - DTC for Loss of Communication with ICC (U15B0-87) is not present  - De-bounce timer </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1340650257">Continue</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_714380710">For the message ICC_0 x 52A if - Check Sum verification error occurs in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - Maximum difference of Counter value (MaxDeltaCounterInit) &gt; 1 for 3 times continuously OR - Counter value is repeted in the last 3 consecutive messages OR - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F repeats 3 times continuously</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_675129428">DTC shall not be set if all the conditions below are met and last for 1 period - Check Sum is correct; - Counter maximum difference (MaxDeltaCounterInit)  =  1; - The Counter value is not repeated; - During normal communication between sending node and receiving node, Counter = 0x0F does not appear</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_665772539">- Low critical degradation if following features are disengaged :   Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Car2Car (Inlcuding Following and HeadOn): AEB-C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Pedestrian Collision Mitigation: AEB-VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Standard Forward Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM C2C, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Reverse Cross Traffic Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB: RCTM, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Pedestrian Collision Mitigation (Including Child) AEB-FCTM VRU, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Forward Crossing Cyclist Collision Mitigation: AEB-FCTM Cyc, Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Turn Across Path Vehicle Collision Mitigation: AEB-TAP Evasive Steering Assist (ESA) Lane Keep Assist (LKA) Emergency Lane Departure Avoidance (ELDA)  - Surround View: Rear View Only (Dynamic overlays are possible)   - Features Not available/Disabled:  Automatic Emergency Braking - Premium Rear Automatic Emergency Braking: RAEB Full Automatic Park Assist System (APA), Remote Parking Assist, Lane Change Assist (LCA) Traffic jam assist (TJA) / Integrated Cruise Assist (ICA)/ Lane Centering Control (LCC), Automatic Cruise Control (ACC) Including Stop and Go, Intelligent Speed Assist (ISA), Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR), Traffic Light Recognition (TLR)  - Features functionality degraded :   Personal Park Assist, Blind Spot Monitoring (BSM), Door Opening Incident Warning (DOIW)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_491091207">40 Drive Cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_149327311">1. The ECU/module is gone to sleep 2. Gateway forwarding error 3. Associated ECU Fault</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_575598777">Features relying on ICC messages will be degraded or unavailable</SD>
