                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_927612769">The communication bus off returns to normal and valid for 10 ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_262404557">Record DTC; Function degradation - Rear View Only - No Dynamic Overlays - Image Defeat not selectable After 2000 ms (from Ready Sleep state to Prepare Bus sleep time), no view will be displayed, go to Shutdown mode</SD>
