                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1451217794">10ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_6567299">If any one of the following conditions is met, the DTC shall be logged    SOC temperature is not within range (-40 to 125 deg C) for 5 sec  OR   No read or write access to NVM  OR   ECU RAM Test failure for 5 sec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_209690546">Hydra3_component shall not log any DTC if all the conditions below are True-    SOC Temperature is within range (-40 to 125 deg C) for 1 sec       Can read or write into NVM      ECU RAM detection is successful in the next power-on cycle</SD>
