                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1290482742">1. Failure in the CAN communication chain 2. Gateway forwarding error 3. Associated ECU Fault 4. CAN harness fault 5. Connector looseness</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_1907741670">Features that are relying on MCU_Front and MCU_Rear messages will be degraded or unavailable</SD>
